{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《美食強人》今晚品評廣州代表的「老廣新味藤椒蝦餃」，其創新的藤椒口味引發評審團正反兩極的激烈辯論！然而，當評審發現蝦餃皮一夾即穿時，戰火再度升級，「最年輕黑珍珠一鑽主理人」葉林輝更拋出超狠批評，直指這是不能接受的失誤，場面極度尷尬！\n</p>\n<h2>藤椒配蝦係咪Friend？歐陽應霽滕麗名林澄光意見大對立</h2>\n<p>廣州代表的蝦餃在顏色上呈現「兩紅兩綠」，更在蝦餃上放了兩粒藤椒，賣相獨特。不過，藤椒的味道是否與蝦配合，卻讓評審們意見分裂。「飲食文化人」歐陽應霽大讚藤椒與蝦的結合非常出色；滕麗名亦表示：「藤椒個味係可以勾起蝦嘅鮮味。」但「飲食達人」林澄光則唱反調，直言：「藤椒同蝦餃餡唔係好 Friend。」「連續 7 年米芝蓮三星食府主理人」黃隆滔亦坦言，雖然接受創新，但仍較喜歡該店的傳統蝦餃。</p>\n<h2>葉林輝見蝦餃皮一夾就穿怒轟：不應該係廚師端出去嘅嘢</h2>\n<p>口味爭議未平，技術問題又起。幾位評審在試食期間，均發現該店的蝦餃皮非常容易夾穿，基本功受到質疑。對此，「最年輕黑珍珠一鑽主理人」葉林輝毫不留情面，作出極嚴厲的批評，他表情嚴肅地說：「我覺得這是不應該是一個廚師能端出去的東西，這和肉沒有做熟的概念是一樣的。」此話一出，令全場氣氛瞬間凝結。</p>\n<h2>網民震驚葉林輝超敢言：基本功都做唔好就唔好搞創新</h2>\n<p>葉林輝的犀利點評在網上引起極大迴響，不少網民都對其敢言作風表示佩服。「葉林輝講嘢好狠，但好啱！蝦餃皮都穿，仲講咩創新？」「嘩，『同肉未熟一樣』，呢句真係好重手，個廚師聽到實喊。」「其實藤椒配海鮮幾好食喎，可能係個廚師手藝問題。」「支持創新，但前提係基本功要紮實。」「呢個節目啲評審好專業，唔會一味讚，夠真實！」</p>\n<h2>建國酒店 瑩豐閣</h2>\n<p>地址：廣州市天河區林和中路172號廣州建國酒店4樓</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_812334796af5421f26aa0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_812334796af5421f26aa0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_16228506256af54254d5d68.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_16228506256af54254d5d68.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_16699690666af542582573e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_16699690666af542582573e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_7622120716af5425bac013.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_7622120716af5425bac013.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T17:04:19.440740+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":987,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T16:39:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:54.329524+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:57:46.994973+00:00","content_hash":"e14f606146d4ad055eb8e2744f7791462a1f627753af61d9bd2ce39fa926a09c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}